/**
 * @page supported_arch Supported Architectures
 *
 * RAZE is optimized for the x86 (and x86-64) architecture. The library automatically 
 * detects and adapts to the host CPU's capabilities, utilizing the most advanced instruction 
 * sets available at compile time or runtime (see @ref dynamic_dispatch).
 *
 * The minimum supported architecture is **SSE2** (the x86-64 baseline).
 *
 * ### Supported Instruction Sets
 *
 * The following ISA extensions are fully supported and utilized by the backend:
 *
 * | Family | Supported Extensions |
 * | :--- | :--- |
 * | **SSE** | SSE2, SSE3, SSSE3, SSE4.1, SSE4.2 |
 * | **AVX** | AVX, AVX2, FMA3 |
 * | **AVX-512** | AVX512F, AVX512VL, AVX512BW, AVX512DQ, AVX512VBMI, AVX512VBMI2 |
 */